        "Recognize the knowledge representation and learning methods of artificial intelligence",
        "Apply recognition techniques, including machine learning algorithms, to identify patterns and features in large datasets",
        "Apply basic principles of AI in solutions that required problem solving perception and learning"
      ]
    },
